# PMax Asset Group Creation Checklist

## Campaign Pre-Requisites

- [ ] Conversion tracking active at account level (30+ conversions in last 30 days)
- [ ] Customer-match audience list uploaded (converting customers)
- [ ] Campaign status: PAUSED
- [ ] Budget: $[X]/day ([X * 1,000,000] micros) — minimum 3x target CPA
- [ ] URL expansion: disabled for lead-gen, enabled for broad e-commerce
- [ ] account-level negative keywords for brand terms added (via support request)

## Asset Group: {{ name }}

### Text Assets (validated char limits)

| Type | Min | Count | Char Limit | Status |
|------|-----|-------|-----------|--------|
| HEADLINE | 5 | {{ headline }} | 30 | [ ] |
| LONG_HEADLINE | 5 | {{ long_headline }} | 90 | [ ] |
| DESCRIPTION | 4 | {{ description }} | 90 | [ ] |
| BUSINESS_NAME | 1 | 1 | — | [ ] |

### Image Assets

| Type | Min | Count | Dimensions | Status |
|------|-----|-------|-----------|--------|
| MARKETING_IMAGE | 4 | {{ marketing_image }} | 1200x628 | [ ] |
| SQUARE_MARKETING_IMAGE | 2 | {{ square_marketing_image }} | 1200x1200 | [ ] |
| LOGO | 1 | {{ logo }} | 128x128+ | [ ] |

### Video Assets (optional, recommended)

- [ ] YouTube videos added for YouTube placements

### Final URLs

- [ ] final_url set to HTTPS URL
- [ ] URL loads correctly and conversion fires on destination page

### Audience Signals

- [ ] Customer-match list (converting customers) added
- [ ] Remarketing list (site visitors) added

## Go-Live Gate

- [ ] All minimum asset counts met
- [ ] Human brand-safety review of generated copy complete
- [ ] Campaign status changed to ENABLED by human
